        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Page of the illustrated manuscript \"The Illustrated Regulations for Ceremonial Paraphernalia of the Present Dynasty.\" It bears an explanatory text about one of the Emperor's winter court robes.\n\nPage of the illustrated manuscript \"The Illustrated Regulations for Ceremonial Paraphernalia of the Present Dynasty.\" It bears an explanatory text about one of the Emperor's winter court robes."@en ;
